TuRiin is a [[Bestiary/Kaathe|Kaathe]] of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], met as a floating orb of soft blue-green light. He is the handler for many of Sedecium's operatives, the voice that briefs a crew before it sets out, and he takes the post of vice captain aboard the [[Geography/Heavy Hand of God|Heavy Hand of God]].
